{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve Box-Pushing Puzzles &amp; Collect All Fishes</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing as an explosive kitten Coco,use the pipes and walls in the environment to push boxes, blow up obstacles, solve puzzles, and don't miss a single dried fish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739300/extras/a1c14a00ebaeec76cb5e097efc1543f1.poster.avif?t=1772182942\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739300/extras/a1c14a00ebaeec76cb5e097efc1543f1.webm?t=1772182942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739300/extras/a1c14a00ebaeec76cb5e097efc1543f1.mp4?t=1772182942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Chain Blasts &amp; Conquer Mind Mazes</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel from the warm sunflower field to the midsummer rainforest, late autumn ruins, snow-covered wasteland... Each area has unique explosive cartons. Use the power of the extrusion pipes to blast through the maze blocking you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739300/extras/20db52fec4dae6d5e06dceb9375d72f8.poster.avif?t=1772182942\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739300/extras/20db52fec4dae6d5e06dceb9375d72f8.webm?t=1772182942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739300/extras/20db52fec4dae6d5e06dceb9375d72f8.mp4?t=1772182942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background"